  <description>
    Elevated Railway Viaduct and Concrete Pier Structures (台鐵高架鐵路橋樑與橋墩) for the Liujia/Neiwan Line crossing Guanxin Road, featuring double-track box girder, T-pier columns (clearance &gt; 5.2m), yellow/black hazard warning stripes, acrylic noise barriers, and catenary masts.
